			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				172,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Output): Add inline stub fallback for missing NLS files\n\nAdd tier 4 fallback mechanism using inline `data:text/javascript` stubs for files that stock VS Code generates only during the localization step. The build pipeline doesn't run the per-locale NLS generation, so `nls.messages.js`, `nls.keys.json`, `nls.messages.json`, and `nls.metadata.json` don't exist on disk.\n\nWithout this fallback, the webview 404s to the SPA fallback and the browser reports `Unexpected token '<'` on the HTML response - the exact cold-boot failure mode this plugin step exists to prevent.\n\nThe stub bodies are valid modules/JSON: the empty NLS array causes the runtime to fall through to the per-call fallback string every `localize(id, fallback, ...)` callsite already passes.",
			"SHA": "57d46b488683302c04bef581c1f855775e63cf0a"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-25T01:30:00Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⣿⣿⠀⠀",
				172,
				104
			],
			"Message": "build(Output): Minify Configuration files in Output element\n\nThe Configuration directory contains ESBuild configs (Editor, Exclude, Microsoft, Output, RestPlugin), Plugin configs (Apply, Copy, Index, Transform, Type), Polyfill configs (ChildProcess, FileProtocol, FileSystem, IPCRenderer, NativeModule, Process, SharedProcess), and Service configs (DevLog, TauriMainProcess, Trace) that were previously in verbose source form.\n\nThis commit minifies all Configuration JS files and removes the corresponding source map files, converting the configuration from development-readable format to production-optimized build artifacts. The minified versions maintain identical functionality while reducing bundle size and improving load times.\n\nThe configuration files are now ready to be consumed by the Output element's build pipeline for bundling the VS Code platform code.",
			"SHA": "0b1561ccb77d0ba6a6ef714585f5b570bf6bbb47"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-25T00:25:23Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⣿⠇⠀⠀",
				224,
				108
			],
			"Message": "",
			"SHA": "36dbc44e8e18e6eca5c3ec295e114f1b964783ff"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-25T00:07:03Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿",
				99,
				108
			],
			"Message": "chore(Output): Remove Configuration directory from Output element\n\nDelete all configuration files from the Output element including ESBuild configs (Editor, Exclude, Microsoft, Output, RestPlugin), Plugin configs (Apply, Copy, Index, Transform, Type), Polyfill configs (ChildProcess, FileProtocol, FileSystem, IPCRenderer, NativeModule, Process, SharedProcess), Service configs (DevLog, TauriMainProcess, Trace), and tsconfig files.\n\nThis removes the inline build configuration, likely to be replaced with externalized or generated configuration files.",
			"SHA": "b721788912126ddfc26df11700f46acd07ac4f3b"
		},
